<title>USA: FSA qualifies seven muni issues for bond insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies seven muni issues for bond insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Monday it qualified for bond insurance the following seven municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Onsted Community School District, Mich., $11.575 million general obligation bonds.  </p>
<p>--Fargo Public School District No. 6, N.D., $6.32 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Moorhead Independent School District No 152, Minn., $5.15 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Northeast Johnson County CSD No2, Kan., $2.5 million GOs.</p>
<p>--St. Peter, Minnn., $2.275 million revenue bonds.</p>
<p>--Wisconsin Indianhead Technical College, $2.05 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Mahtomedi, Minn., $1.615 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
